            "kind": "REWORK",
            "comments": [
                {
                    "file": "/PATCHSET_LEVEL",
                    "line": 0,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Andrew Jeffery",
                        "email": "andrew@codeconstruct.com.au",
                        "username": "amboar"
                    },
                    "message": "I'd rather this be a property of the EM configuration. I have a strong preference against build-time configuraiton."
                },
                {
                    "file": "/PATCHSET_LEVEL",
                    "line": 0,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Eric Yang",
                        "email": "eric.yang.wiwynn@gmail.com",
                        "username": "fornchu110"
                    },
                    "message": "May I kindly ask if you are suggesting adding some retry information in the JSON file through the EM, and then having the D-Bus sensors read the retry count to perform the retry?\nIf so, do you have any specific recommendations on how to implement this in the EM?\n\nI appreciate your suggestions, and the reason I am considering this change is that our system experienced a `GetSubtree` timeout, which resulted in the D-Bus sensors being unable to retrieve the sensors defined in the EM's configuration. Consequently, the fan sensor was not created. \n\nThank you very much!"
                },
                {
                    "file": "/PATCHSET_LEVEL",
                    "line": 0,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Alexander",
                        "email": "alexander.hansen@9elements.com",
                        "username": "pointbazaar"
                    },
                    "message": "If this goes through, it would have to be replicated for each sensor, right?\nSince it is not specific to fan sensor.\n\nCan you simply increase the dbus timeout?\n\nDo you know what is causing the timeout, is there any service doing any expensive calculations?"
                },
                {
                    "file": "/PATCHSET_LEVEL",
                    "line": 0,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Andrew Jeffery",
                        "email": "andrew@codeconstruct.com.au",
                        "username": "amboar"
                    },
                    "message": "> the reason I am considering this change is that our system experienced a GetSubtree timeout\n\nThen I think you need to understand why that's occurring and fix it, instead of papering over it here."
                },
                {
                    "file": "/PATCHSET_LEVEL",
                    "line": 0,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Eric Yang",
                        "email": "eric.yang.wiwynn@gmail.com",
                        "username": "fornchu110"
                    },
                    "message": "> Do you know what is causing the timeout, is there any service doing any expensive calculations?\n>\nDue to our multi-host system, where one BMC needs to manage 8 hosts and monitor over 2000 sensors, I believe the GetSubtree connection timed out because the dbus was too busy during the boot phase, with many services initializing and performing tasks simultaneously.\n\n> Then I think you need to understand why that's occurring and fix it, instead of papering over it here.\n>\nThank you very much for your guidance. I am currently attempting to increase the dbus timeout for the entire system to try to resolve these issues.\n\nThank you for your suggestions."
                }
            ],
